      "value": "A simpler fix would be to make a chat window in the \"Escape\" menu that is room-wide rather than trying to fancy and have it be visual in the world.\n\nPlus you can also hit the \"communicate with someone far away (outside of voice range) in the same room\" bird with the same stone.",
