      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5adfa711a8ca626f7bf243ae|full_name}: Unfortunately, today, technical tools are not able to eliminate completely the language barrier. However, it can be reduced. Once I tried to talk to a Japanese. I do not know Japanese, and he spoke English very bad. In general, we was not able to talk to each other. Then I thought that if there were a text chat with an electronic translator, then we would be able to communicate.",
